{"id":"631554","name":"豆腐甘蓝素馅包子","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631554/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"甘蓝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"4克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"220克"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"甘蓝、木耳切好。","img":"images/631554/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切好。","img":"images/631554/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜切好。","img":"images/631554/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐切小块。","img":"images/631554/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放油，炒制金黄，撒花椒粉炒香。","img":"images/631554/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"所有馅料放在一起，放入所有调料。","img":"images/631554/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/631554/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"提前发好的面团。","img":"images/631554/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉面脾气，分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/631554/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀成包子皮。","img":"images/631554/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入馅料，收口。","img":"images/631554/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包子包好，二次醒发。","img":"images/631554/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/631554/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631554/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"里面还有两个茴香馅的。","img":"images/631554/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}